  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norway-AU strategic partnership framework agreement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A framework agreement to support the impementation of African Union Agenda 2063 and its Medium Term Plan in the areas of Peace and Security, Sustainable Development and Job Creation, Democracy and Governance and Institutional Capacity Building. including gender strategy and mainstreaming programs.</narrative>
  </description>
